**New grammar contributions:**

```
1. frames[ecomorphic] — new RELATION value
   The framing structure simulates the deity's
   natural habitat rather than architectural or
   cosmological context.

2. Aspirational naming convention
   顺天宫 encodes an aspiration/cosmic value as
   the institutional name rather than a deity,
   locality, or doctrinal content.

3. Psychopomp as threshold configuration
   大二爷伯 as a threshold deity, contrasted with
   the Menshen (door-god) bilateral pair configuration
   documented at Loyang. Two distinct threshold
   pairing conventions now documented.

4. Tiger God — ecomorphic floor/ground threshold
   Adds to the corpus of threshold-guardian types:
   Door Gods (purely apotropaic), Tiger God (earth-
   guardian, ecomorphic), 大二爷伯 (psychopomp).
```

